This product is an Amaranth HDL reimplementation of SAT-Accel
("SAT-Accel: A Modern SAT Solver on a FPGA", M. Lo, M.-C. F. Chang, J. Cong,
FPGA '25), based on its HLS sources (openhw-2025-SAT-FPGA, Team AOHW25-894:
M. Lo, H. Ke, T. Nowatzki, J. Cong), licensed under the Apache License 2.0.

SAT_test_cases/ is copied from openhw-2025-SAT-FPGA (Apache License 2.0).
benchmarks/satlib/ contains instances from SATLIB (H. H. Hoos, T. Stuetzle),
https://www.cs.ubc.ca/~hoos/SATLIB/.
